      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<p>Fabio is a Software Engineer, conference speaker, and community leader based in Amsterdam. While building his own start-up, he fell in love with Akka, Scala, and Reactive systems. So much so that he founded the 2000-member strong Reactive Amsterdam meetup group. When he doesn’t happen to be in front of a screen, he enjoys long-distance bike rides and fingerpicking his guitar.</p>"
